    <string name="hud_full">Full info</string>
    <string name="hud_hint">Full info shows a bar at the top: GPU and CPU load, memory, power draw, temperature and an FPS graph. Handy to see what slows the game down.</string>
    <string name="fps_cap_label">Frame rate limit</string>
    <string name="fps_cap_hint">Caps FPS to smooth out swings and save battery. Try 60 or 30 if the counter jumps around.</string>
    <string name="texq_label">Texture compression</string>
    <string name="texq_hint">Shrinks textures to save memory and gain FPS: No = half size, Low = a quarter, Ultra low = an eighth. The lower, the faster and the blurrier.</string>
    <string name="texq_no">No</string>
